{"seq":15,"slug":"frontend-observability","title":"前端监控与可观测性","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":19,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"前端监控与可观测性\">前端监控与可观测性</h1><p>前端监控与可观测性回答一个生产环境的根本问题：「用户那边到底发生了什么？」它把散落的 JS 异常、性能数据和用户行为整合为日志、指标、追踪三类信号，构建「采集 → 传输 → 存储 → 分析 → 告警」的完整闭环，让团队从「用户投诉才知道出事」进化到「异常发生几分钟内主动定位」。本 hub 覆盖这条链路的全部四段：监控体系设计、错误追踪、性能监控、平台工程落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>「监控」很容易和「优化」「错误处理」混为一谈。下表划清本 hub 与 <code>01_frontend</code> 下最易混淆的兄弟 hub 的边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>分工边界</th>\n<th>什么时候去那边</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>性能优化</td>\n<td>本 hub 回答「指标如何被<strong>持续量化</strong>、异常如何被<strong>发现</strong>」；那边回答「瓶颈定位后如何<strong>动手优化</strong>」</td>\n<td>指标已经变红，需要改造加载策略、拆包、渲染路径时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前端性能优化与 Core Web Vitals</td>\n<td>那边以 Core Web Vitals 为主线讲「度量 → 优化 → 守护」的单域方法论；本 hub 把性能作为三支柱之一，与错误、链路、平台并列成完整体系</td>\n<td>只关注性能单域、想系统学 CWV 优化方法论时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前端性能监控体系</td>\n<td>那边是性能监控单维度的深潜（合成测试 vs 真实用户监控、性能数据平台）；本 hub 是错误 + 性能 + 链路 + 平台的横向全景</td>\n<td>要把性能监控这一项做深做专时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前端错误处理与降级</td>\n<td>那边回答「出错后如何让产品对用户<strong>仍可用</strong>」（错误边界、降级、兜底）；本 hub 回答「出错后如何被<strong>发现、定位与收敛</strong>」（捕获 → 还原 → 聚合 → 告警）</td>\n<td>设计 Error Boundary、降级方案等容错逻辑时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器原理与 Web API</td>\n<td>那边讲 PerformanceObserver、事件循环等机制<strong>本身</strong>；本 hub 讲这些 API 在监控 SDK 中的<strong>工程化运用</strong></td>\n<td>想理解采集 API 的运行时语义与兼容性细节时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：兄弟 hub 教你「把事情做好」，本 hub 教你「知道事情做得好不好、哪里出了问题」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本 hub 前，建议具备：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>JavaScript 异步模型</strong>：Promise、async/await、事件循环——错误捕获（unhandledrejection）与上报调度直接建立在其上</li>\n<li><strong>浏览器事件模型</strong>：捕获/冒泡阶段、<code>addEventListener</code> 选项——资源错误必须在捕获阶段拦截才能拿到</li>\n<li><strong>HTTP 与网络基础</strong>：缓存头、CORS、请求生命周期——Resource Timing 分阶段耗时与跨域 <code>Script error.</code> 问题都依赖这些概念</li>\n<li><strong>前端工程化常识</strong>：打包压缩产物、CI/CD 流水线的基本形态——Source Map 上传与 Release 关联章节需要</li>\n<li><strong>TypeScript 阅读能力</strong>：全部示例代码为 TypeScript 接口定义加实现，不需要写过，但要能读懂类型签名</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>各章内部文档按编号即默认阅读顺序。不同角色的推荐路线如下：</p>\n<p><strong>路径 A · 业务前端工程师（给自己的应用接入监控）</strong> —— 全景路线，按章顺序：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>第一章全部（<a href=\"monitoring-fundamentals/observability-overview\">可观测性概述</a> → <a href=\"monitoring-fundamentals/metrics-dimensions\">指标与维度</a> → <a href=\"monitoring-fundamentals/data-collection\">数据采集</a>）：建立「采什么、怎么采」的全局认知</li>\n<li>第二章按错误处理链路（<a href=\"error-tracking/error-capture\">错误捕获</a> → <a href=\"error-tracking/sourcemap\">Source Map 还原</a> → <a href=\"error-tracking/error-aggregation\">聚合降噪</a> → <a href=\"error-tracking/session-replay\">会话回放</a>）：打通从拦截到定位的闭环</li>\n<li>第三章先读 <a href=\"performance-monitoring/web-vitals\">Web Vitals</a> 与 <a href=\"performance-monitoring/user-experience-metrics\">用户体验指标</a>，遇到加载问题再回看两篇 Resource Timing 文档</li>\n<li>第四章按选型二选一深入：用 Sentry 走 <a href=\"observability-platforms/sentry-platform\">平台全景</a> + <a href=\"observability-platforms/sentry-integration\">深度集成</a>；自研则走 <a href=\"observability-platforms/opentelemetry\">OpenTelemetry</a> + <a href=\"observability-platforms/custom-platform\">自建平台</a>，最后补 <a href=\"observability-platforms/alerting-oncall\">告警与 On-Call</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>路径 B · 稳定性 / 质量保障负责人</strong> —— 关注度量口径与响应机制：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"monitoring-fundamentals/metrics-dimensions\">监控指标与维度体系</a>：确定团队的北极星指标与告警阈值</li>\n<li><a href=\"error-tracking/error-capture\">错误捕获与分类</a> → <a href=\"error-tracking/error-aggregation\">错误聚合与降噪</a>：理解错误率数字是怎么来的、有多少噪音</li>\n<li><a href=\"observability-platforms/alerting-oncall\">告警体系与 On-Call 实践</a>：分级 SLA、降噪配额与轮值制度</li>\n<li><a href=\"observability-platforms/sentry-platform\">Sentry 与错误监控平台</a>：评估采购 vs 自建的决策依据</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>路径 C · 平台 / 基础设施工程师（造监控轮子）</strong> —— 关注架构与协议：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"monitoring-fundamentals/observability-overview\">前端可观测性概述</a>：四层架构（采集/传输/存储/消费）与采样治理</li>\n<li><a href=\"monitoring-fundamentals/data-collection\">数据采集与上报策略</a>：SDK 传输层的可靠性设计</li>\n<li><a href=\"observability-platforms/opentelemetry\">OpenTelemetry 前端集成</a> → <a href=\"observability-platforms/full-link-tracing\">全链路追踪</a>：标准化数据模型与 W3C Trace Context 协议</li>\n<li><a href=\"observability-platforms/custom-platform\">自建可观测平台</a>：ClickHouse 存储选型与实时告警引擎</li>\n<li><a href=\"error-tracking/sourcemap-analysis\">Source Map 深度解析</a>：平台必须自研的堆栈还原组件</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>快速速览（半天）</strong>：<a href=\"monitoring-fundamentals/observability-overview\">可观测性概述</a> → <a href=\"error-tracking/error-capture\">错误捕获与分类</a> → <a href=\"performance-monitoring/web-vitals\">Web Vitals 深度解析</a> → <a href=\"observability-platforms/sentry-platform\">Sentry 与错误监控平台</a>，即可对整个领域建立可用的工作认知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>以下兄弟 hub 与本 hub 主题相邻，可作为下一步探索入口（本 hub 内容不依赖它们）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../frontend-error-handling/\">前端错误处理与降级</a>：错误被发现之后，如何让产品对用户仍然可用</li>\n<li><a href=\"../web-performance-vitals/\">前端性能优化与 Core Web Vitals</a>：指标变红之后的系统性优化方法论</li>\n<li><a href=\"../frontend-performance-monitoring/\">前端性能监控体系</a>：把性能监控单维度做深做专</li>\n<li><a href=\"../browser-and-web-api/\">浏览器原理与 Web API</a>：本 hub 所用采集 API 的底层运行时机制</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monitoring-fundamentals","title":"监控基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/monitoring-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observability-overview","title":"前端可观测性概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/monitoring-fundamentals/observability-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"metrics-dimensions","title":"监控指标与维度体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/monitoring-fundamentals/metrics-dimensions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-collection","title":"数据采集与上报策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/monitoring-fundamentals/data-collection"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"error-tracking","title":"错误追踪","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/error-tracking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"error-capture","title":"错误捕获与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/error-tracking/error-capture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sourcemap-analysis","title":"Source Map 深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/error-tracking/sourcemap-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"error-aggregation","title":"错误聚合与降噪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/error-tracking/error-aggregation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sourcemap","title":"Source Map 与错误还原","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/error-tracking/sourcemap"},{"seq":5,"slug":"session-replay","title":"用户会话回放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/error-tracking/session-replay"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-monitoring","title":"性能监控","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/performance-monitoring","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"web-vitals","title":"Web Vitals 深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/performance-monitoring/web-vitals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-monitoring","title":"资源加载与网络监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/performance-monitoring/resource-monitoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"long-task-analysis","title":"长任务检测与主线程分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/performance-monitoring/long-task-analysis"},{"seq":4,"slug":"resource-timing","title":"Resource Timing 分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/performance-monitoring/resource-timing"},{"seq":5,"slug":"user-experience-metrics","title":"用户体验指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/performance-monitoring/user-experience-metrics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"observability-platforms","title":"可观测性平台","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sentry-platform","title":"Sentry 与错误监控平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/sentry-platform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"opentelemetry","title":"OpenTelemetry 前端集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/opentelemetry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"alerting-oncall","title":"告警体系与 On-Call 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/alerting-oncall"},{"seq":4,"slug":"full-link-tracing","title":"全链路追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/full-link-tracing"},{"seq":5,"slug":"sentry-integration","title":"Sentry 深度集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/sentry-integration"},{"seq":6,"slug":"custom-platform","title":"自建可观测平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/custom-platform"}]}]}